  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;event denotes&nbsp;the selection for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mi>st</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;bag</p><p>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;event&nbsp;denotes the selection for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>nd</mi></msup></math>&nbsp;bag</p><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Let the event&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo></math>&nbsp;selected balls are&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;red &amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;black</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>1</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mn>6</mn></mmultiscripts></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>3</mn></mmultiscripts><mo>&#215;</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>1</mn><none/><mprescripts/><none/><mn>2</mn></mmultiscripts></mrow><msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>A</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mn>11</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
